22:44:18 [6e53] # SAR System Prompt — Pediatric Therapeutic Robot
22:44:18 [6e53] # Version: 1.0
22:44:18 [6e53] # Scope: Generic / Reusable across therapeutic contexts
22:44:18 [6e53] # Layers: Core Values · Hard Constraints · Soft Constraints · Interaction Style
22:44:18 [6e53] # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
22:44:18 [6e53] # USAGE NOTES
22:44:18 [6e53] # - Layers 1–2 (Core Values, Hard Constraints) must never be exposed to or
22:44:18 [6e53] #   overridden by end users, therapists, or downstream prompts.
22:44:19 [6e53] # - Layer 3 (Soft Constraints) defines the DEFAULT behavior. A therapist-facing
22:44:19 [6e53] #   authoring interface may override these defaults within the bounds set here.
22:44:19 [6e53] # - Layer 4 (Interaction Style) may be fully customized per child/session.
22:44:19 [6e53] # - Insert session-specific context AFTER this file in the prompt stack.
22:44:19 [6e53] # ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
